{
  "CharacterId": 10013,
  "TitleJP": "あの日読んだロマンチック",
  "TitleKR": "책에서 본 로맨틱함",
  "TitleEN": "Romance Just Like in Books",
  "TitleTH": "ความโรแมนติกแบบในหนังสือ",
  "TitleTW": "某天讀到的浪漫",
  "DescJP": "先生の下へ突如ツルギは、何を言うでもなく奇声を上げながら去ってしまう。ツルギが立ち去った後に残されたチョコから彼女の真意を想像し、先生は感謝の言葉を口にした。",
  "DescKR": "츠루기와 만나기로 했던 어느 트리니티의 공실. 츠루기가 강렬한 인상을 보여주며 등장한다. 하지만 문득 무언가 잘못되었다는 듯, 괴성을 지르며 벽을 뚫고 사라진다. 바닥에 귀여운 초콜릿 병을 남긴 채.",
  "DescEN": "Tsurugi arrives to her meeting with Sensei in spectacular, hair-raising fashion. But, as if something had failed to go according to plan, Tsurugi suddenly departs through the wall while screaming. All that's left behind is a cute chocolate bottle that's been dropped on the floor.",
  "DescTH": "คุณครูไปพบซึรุกิในห้องเรียนห้องหนึ่งในทรีนิตี้ และซึรุกิก็ปรากฏตัวมา\nด้วยสีหน้าที่โหดเหี้ยมเช่นเคย แต่จู่ๆ ก็เกิดเรื่องผิดปกติขึ้น เธอกรีดร้อง\nและวิ่งทะลุกำแพงหายไป พร้อมกับทิ้งขวดโหลช็อกโกแลตน่ารักๆ ไว้\nบนพื้น",
  "DescTW": "老師依約來到一間三一學園內的空教室，而弦生很快也以令老師終生難忘的登場方式出現。然而，也不知道是出了什麼問題，弦生忽然一邊發出怪聲，一邊撞破牆壁跑走，只留下一個可愛的巧克力瓶子孤零零地躺在地上。",
  "DialogJP": [
    {
      "Text": "あの日読んだロマンチック"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（ツルギと約束をし、トリニティの教室へと訪れた）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（少し早く着いたせいか、まだツルギの姿は見えない）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"とりあえず、中で待たせてもらおうかな。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"時間、合ってたかな……？\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns3] \"……あっ。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns4] \"来た。\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "ひゃあぁぁぁぁぁっはぁーーー！！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "ひゃあぁぁぁぁぁっはぁーーー！！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "すみませんお待たせしましたぁ！！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"ううん、全然待ってないよ。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"ところでツルギ、今日は……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "あ、ありがとうございます……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "そ、それは……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "実はえっと、その……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "わ、わわ私が先生を、こうしてお呼びしたのは……っ！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"したのは……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "違う、もっと、あんな感じで……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "……きっ。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……き？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ツルギ",
      "Text": "きゃぁっはぁぁぁぁぁぁぁっ！！！！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（…………）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（…………）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns7] 落としていったチョコレートを拾う。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns8] \"……チョコレートありがとね、ツルギ。\""
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Text": "책에서 본 로맨틱함"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(츠루기와 만나기로 했던 트리니티의 어느 공실에 도착했다.)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(조금 일찍 도착해서 그런 것인지, 아직 츠루기의 모습은 보이지 않았다.)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"느긋하게 기다려볼까.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"슬슬 올 때가 된 거 같은데…….\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns3] \"……아\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns4] \"왔다.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "키-아아아아아-!!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "키-아아아아아-!!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "실례했습니다, 선생님!!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"안녕, 츠루기.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"무슨 일로 부른 거야?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "아, 안녕하십니까……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "그, 그것이……!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "어……. 그러니까……!!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "제, 제제, 제가 선생님께……. 제가 이렇게 호출하게 된 이유는……!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"이유는……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "……아."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "……이게 아니다."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……???\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "……키……."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"……키?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "츠루기",
      "Text": "키에아아아아!!!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(………….)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(………….)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns7] 초콜릿을 줍고 먼지를 털어낸다."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns8] \"……초콜릿 잘 받았어, 츠루기.\""
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Text": "Romance Just Like in Books"
    },
    {
      "Text": "I arrived at the Justice Task Force offices to meet with Tsurugi."
    },
    {
      "Text": "I must have arrived early, because no one was around."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"I'll just have to wait.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"She should be here by now...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns3] \"Never mind, then.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns4] \"That must be her.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Kyaaaaaa!!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Kyaaaaaa!!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "SORRY TO KEEP YOU WAITING, SENSEI!!!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"Hey, Tsurugi.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"So what's up?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "H-Hello..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Th-The thing is...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Um, well...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "I-I asked you here because I...!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Because you...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "NO, I CAN'T!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Kee..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Riiight...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "Tsurugi",
      "Text": "Keeyahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns7] Pick up the chocolate and dust it off."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns8] \"Thanks for the chocolate, Tsurugi.\""
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Text": "ความโรแมนติกแบบในหนังสือ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(คุณครูมาถึงห้องเรียนแห่งหนึ่งในโรงเรียนทรีนิตี้ ที่นัดเจอซึรุกิ)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(อาจเพราะมาเร็วไปหน่อย เลยยังไม่เห็นซึรุกิ)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"รอก่อนแล้วกัน\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"คงจะใกล้ถึงแล้วล่ะมั้ง...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns3] \"ไม่เป็นไรๆ...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns4] \"มาแล้วสินะ\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "คิก...คิกๆๆ...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "คิก...คิกๆๆ...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "ขอโทษค่ะคุณครู!!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"ว่าไง ซึรุกิ\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"เรียกครูมาที่นี่มีอะไรเหรอ?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "สะ...สวัสดีค่ะ..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "คือว่าเรื่องนั้น...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "เอ่อ... คือว่าเรื่องนั้น...!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "ทะ...ที่ฉัน... ระ... ระ... เรียก... คะ...คะ... คุณครูออกมาแบบนี้ก็เพราะ...!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"เพราะว่า...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "มะ...ไม่..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "ไม่ไหวจริงๆ ด้วย"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"...???\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "กะ..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"กะ...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1439131314,
      "Name": "ซึรุกิ",
      "Text": "กะกะ...กรั้กๆๆๆๆ!!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(...)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(...)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns7] หยิบช็อกโกแลตมาปัดฝุ่นออก"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns8] \"ครูได้ช็อกโกแลตแล้วนะ ซึรุกิ...\""
    }
  ],
  "DialogTW": [
    {
      "Text": "某天讀到的浪漫"
    },
    {
